+Notes: Deploying Rekor on Kubernetes
+- For production, deploy Rekor using the Helm chart or a Deployment + PVC + Service behind an ALB/Ingress.
+- Ensure you provide storage (S3 or PVC+RDB per Rekor configuration) and point REKOR_SERVER to the service URL.
+- Configure TLS via Cert-Manager and Ingress.
+- Configure logs to be forwarded to your logging backend (Fluentd/FluentBit).
