*** Add File:ops/vault/externalsecrets_setup.md
+ExternalSecrets + Vault quick setup
+
+1. Ensure Vault Kubernetes auth is enabled and a Vault role is created:
+   vault auth enable kubernetes
+   vault write auth/kubernetes/role/aegis-external-secrets bound_service_account_names=external-secrets bound_service_account_namespaces=aegis-system policies=cosign-reader ttl=1h
+
+2. Apply SecretStore: kubectl apply -f k8s/external-secrets/secretstore-vault.yaml
+3. Put KMS ARN into Vault:
+   vault kv put secret/data/cosign/prod/key kms_arn="arn:aws:kms:...:key/..."
+4. Create ExternalSecret: kubectl apply -f k8s/external-secrets/externalsecret-cosign.yaml
+5. Verify secret created in k8s: kubectl get secret -n aegis-system cosign-key -o yaml
+
