*** Add File:ops/ci/ci_oidc_examples.md
+CI OIDC examples (brief)
+
+AWS:
+ - Create OIDC provider for GitHub in IAM and trust statements for the repository.
+ - Create role with kms:Sign permissions and allow sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity for GitHub OIDC subject.
+ - Store role ARN in GitHub secret AWS_OIDC_ROLE_ARN.
+ - Use aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials with role-to-assume in the workflow step.
+
+GCP:
+ - Use Workload Identity Federation to allow GitHub OIDC to impersonate a GCP service account with Cloud KMS signer role.
+ - Store SA info in GitHub secrets and configure gcloud auth via the workflow.
+
+Azure:
+ - Use federated credentials on AAD app to allow GitHub OIDC to request tokens to access Key Vault.
+ - Configure Key Vault access policies to allow sign/use operations for the federated identity.
+
